# Build output: the kernel and per-instance rootfs images the spec points at.
# RUNBOOK-micro-cloud.md step 0 rebuilds them; they are large and host-specific, so they
# are not tracked. Plan section 9.1 lists this directory as gitignored build output.
#
# This file itself IS tracked (the `!` line), so a fresh clone gets the directory and the
# reason it is empty, rather than a path the spec references and nothing explains.
*
!.gitignore
